Z||000000||MikeB||06-06-2000||03:12 PM||||Has anyone ever had a problem of random dinging from the ignition key dinger?<BR>I go over a bump in the road and I hear<BR>a couple of dings. It seem to ding when I put on the brake or kick the subwoffer box also.<BR>Any takers on this one?<BR>Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||GT Bastard||06-06-2000||03:31 PM||||Under the passender side of the dash you'll see a rectangular blue box.  Pull it out.  The technical term for it is "dingy-thing."  It's annoying and useless.  You can always plug it back in at a later date if you miss it.||||reg||1
